      "Publish safety and audit trail (Phase 4b; owner: \"Q-05b-5- yes, plan on the group of smaller fixes.\"): if the check for products that would come off the live menu can't run, Publish stops and nothing changes (it says \"Not published yet: the check \u2026 couldn't run\"). Category and inventory-type changes are audited with before and after values. If a sales-limit classification saves to the register but its copy on the lot fails, the lot page says Partly saved instead of Saved; press Save again.",
